  "details": "When using knee tracker and using a avatar that uses \"Force Locomotion animations for 6 point tracking\" the legs are twisting around while walking. the lower to the ground you are, the worse it gets.\nIt happens on all avatars i tried, my own (i only use the default locomotion stuff), from others and vrc default ones. I don't really like to disable locomotion and just glide around, so it would be great if that can get fixed or is there anything i can do myself?\nhere is an example video:\nhttps://youtu.be/5thggNASMVo",
